    <ul>
      <li><strong>Anibal Ollero (T-FR)</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Giuseppe Loianno (T-FR)</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Marco Tognon</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Begoña C. Arrue</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Hyunchul Shim</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Raphael Zufferey</strong></li>
    </ul>

    <p><small>Editorial Board members of T-FR are indicated with “(T-FR)”.</small></p>
  </Workshop2026>
</Base>
